Package: hovernet-server
Version: 0.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: HoverNet Team <devteam@outiva.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, adduser, systemd
Recommends: curl
Description: HoverNet 3.0 authoritative race server (preview)
 Runs races in which the server alone decides every position, lap and result, with a lobby, replays, moderation tools, a status
 port, optional encryption and browser (WebSocket) access behind a TLS-terminating web server. Listens on the loopback address
 until configured in /etc/hovernet/server.conf. Stopping it drains: races under way finish first.
